    <title>08 | 孩子的情绪问题背后，是家庭内部缺少「情绪被看见、疏解」的体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d443e6e924d4525aacb1bc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d443e6e924d4525aacb1bc</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Mar 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎来到《摆上台面》！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👀 你将会听到</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> 为什么小孩会发脾气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 跟小孩讲道理有用吗?不如试试……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a> 有时候不是家长的方法不对，而是……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a> 为什么读过很多养育书，还是调节不好孩子情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1051">17:31</a> 如何培养孩子的情绪调节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">22:11</a> 那从什么时候要开始培养？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1546">25:46</a> 回想一下，大家平时是怎么跟孩子沟通的呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1861">31:01</a> 我比较严肃，说不好「共情的话术」怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2072">34:32</a> 我性子急，怎么调节孩子情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2158">35:58</a> 家长的两难：如何既保护好孩子的情绪，又教好规则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2606">43:26</a> 以前没跟孩子建立好信任，没调节好孩子情绪，现在晚了吗</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果孩子闹情绪，你们会用什么方法去解决呢？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>有什么方法你们会觉得比较管用呢？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论区跟我们留言互动~</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✨ 其他精彩内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/68b1c13e97178f08ee5256e6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/68b1c13e97178f08ee5256e6"><span>01｜当「好好沟通」成为奢侈品：了解自己是沟通的出路</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6767962e1e823e72d3baa719" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6767962e1e823e72d3baa719"><span>03 | 再见爱人有多难：离不开的背后是难以面对「丧失」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67736baf15a5fd520eea6125" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67736baf15a5fd520eea6125"><span>04 | 让人讨厌的泰勒·斯威夫特：愿我们有被讨厌的勇气！</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6793af96247d51713c1ad4aa" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6793af96247d51713c1ad4aa"><span>06 | 家长如何跟孩子聊学习: 教育学博士x心理咨询师对话</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67b35151606e5c5940146588" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67b35151606e5c5940146588"><span>07 | 我们都是小小的我：绝对的「健全」才是非常态</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>摆上台面 |</span></strong><span> 摆上台面，探讨生活中不易谈及的个人成长、亲密关系、社会现象等话题。欢迎订阅我们的播客，你的支持可以鼓励我们创作出更多值得摆上台面的好内容！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>策划&amp;主播 |</span></strong><span> B3 &amp; meimei</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑&amp;文案 |</span></strong><span> meimei</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>编辑 |</span></strong><span> B3</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM |</span></strong><span> Inspector F by Blue Dot Sessions (source: Free Music Archive; license type: CC BY-NC)</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>视频原声来源 |</span></strong><span> 【3岁孩子高铁上吵闹被提醒，一家人轮番上“回应”：已经捂他嘴了 ！】 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xmPueqEWZ/?share_source=copy_web" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xmPueqEWZ/?share_source=copy_web"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
