  <item>
    <title>03 | 再见爱人有多难：离不开的背后是难以面对「丧失」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6767962e1e823e72d3baa719</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6767962e1e823e72d3baa719</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Dec 2024 04:40:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎来到「摆上台面」，我们想继续聊聊《再见爱人》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们常常默认，离不开「好」的关系是很正常的，毕竟ta给我们带来很多积极的体验；相反，对于「不好」的关系，应该更容易离开才对。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但其实，</span><strong><span>不管是什么关系，离开都很难。</span></strong><span>这背后有很多原因，今天我们想摆上台面，聊聊其中一个重要原因：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「离不开的背后，是难以面对丧失」</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区跟我们一起讨论「你们对丧失的看法」 ღ( ´･ᴗ･` )~</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>👀 </span><strong><span>你将会听到</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 明明已经有很多离开的理由，为什么仍选择留在一段关系里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a> 分开，需要面对某种丧失</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">07:41</a> 不管这段关系健康还是不健康，失去都会让人难受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> 反直觉：有时候离不开一段关系，不是因为ta很好，而是因为我们对痛苦上瘾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a> 丧失是一种自然现象：现在很少提及，而以前人们更坦然面对</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a> 消费主义、时代的便利让我们习惯追求「拥有」，而对「丧失」感到陌生，不耐受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> 当「拥有vs.丧失」与「成vs.败」挂钩，我们更难面对丧失</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1505">25:05</a> 面对丧失，女性的枷锁更重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a> 丧失不只在与人的关系上，还可能是……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1921">32:01</a> 一条小皮筋引发的「丧失」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2059">34:19</a>「丧失」可以靠「再拥有」填补吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2511">41:51</a> 面对丧失：ta已经完成了在我们生命历程中的历史使命</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✨ 欢迎收听更多精彩内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/68b1c13e97178f08ee5256e6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/68b1c13e97178f08ee5256e6"><span>01｜当「好好沟通」成为奢侈品：了解自己是沟通的出路</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6745618511045e78e5ff6441" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6745618511045e78e5ff6441"><span>01 |《再见爱人》：不是所有「问题」都能靠沟通解决</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/675046f417cd5416ad7422d4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/675046f417cd5416ad7422d4"><span>02B | 成年后，也要有我们的「朋友支持系统」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67736baf15a5fd520eea6125" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67736baf15a5fd520eea6125"><span>04 | 让人讨厌的泰勒·斯威夫特：愿我们有被讨厌的勇气！</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>摆上台面 |</span></strong><span> 探讨生活中不易谈及的个人成长、亲密关系、社会现象等话题。欢迎订阅我们的播客，你的支持可以鼓励我们创作出更多值得摆上台面的好内容！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>策划&amp;主播 |</span></strong><span> B3 &amp; meimei</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑&amp;文案 |</span></strong><span> meimei</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>编辑 |</span></strong><span> B3</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM |</span></strong><span> Inspector F by Blue Dot Sessions (source: Free Music Archive; license type: CC BY-NC)</span></p>]]></description>
